# M6.7 Phase 1 Slot 01 Repair #4 schema-convergence completion.
#
# Thin successor to the deployed Repair #5 image. It replaces only the coordinator
# persistence module so _migrate_repair_attempt_lineage() converges each required
# schema invariant independently (the marker column's existence is no longer taken
# as proof the constraint migration ran). This completes the Repair #4 migration on
# a database that already has the repair_attempt_lineage_sha256 column but still
# carries the legacy single-column uniqueness constraints. No other file,
# dependency, entry point, or configuration changes; the Repair #5 minimizer
# semantics are untouched.
